@AERIS_API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5271

### =============================================================
### 1. SIMULARE CRAIOVA (LRCV) & SFATURI DECONGESTIONARE / ORBITĂ
### =============================================================

### 1.1 Rulare simulare completă Craiova (Vânt lateral puternic din Sud 180°, 22 kts, rafale 26 kts)
### Savanna și Wilga vor primi recomandare de orbită paralelă cu pista sau deviere la Balta Verde / Podari
GET {{AERIS_API_HostAddress}}/api/craiova/simulation?windSpeed=22&windDirection=180&windGust=26
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.2 Rulare simulare Craiova cu vânt slab (toate aeronavele aterizează în secvență optimă)
GET {{AERIS_API_HostAddress}}/api/craiova/simulation?windSpeed=6&windDirection=090&windGust=8
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.3 Verificare aerodromuri alternative din Oltenia (Balta Verde, Podari, Slatina)
GET {{AERIS_API_HostAddress}}/api/craiova/alternates?windSpeed=22&windDirection=180&cruiseSpeedKnots=70
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.4 Colectare trafic OpenSky Network (LRCV bounding box)
GET {{AERIS_API_HostAddress}}/api/craiova/live-traffic
Accept: application/json

###

### =============================================================
### 2. MOTORUL DE PLANIFICARE GENERAL (SEQUENCING & SCHEDULING)
### =============================================================

### 2.1 Evaluare scenariu demonstrativ (GET)
GET {{AERIS_API_HostAddress}}/api/planning/sample
Accept: application/json

###

### 2.2 Evaluare scenariu custom prin POST
POST {{AERIS_API_HostAddress}}/api/planning/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rules": {
    "minimumGapSeconds": 120,
    "allowVfr": true,
    "baseTimeOffsetSeconds": 50400
  },
  "aircrafts": [
    {
      "id": "IFR1",
      "flightRules": "IFR",
      "etaSeconds": 0,
      "earliestSeconds": 0,
      "latestSeconds": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "IFR2",
      "flightRules": "IFR",
      "etaSeconds": 240,
      "earliestSeconds": 240,
      "latestSeconds": 600
    },
    {
      "id": "IFR3",
      "flightRules": "IFR",
      "etaSeconds": 480,
      "earliestSeconds": 480,
      "latestSeconds": 840
    },
    {
      "id": "VFR",
      "flightRules": "VFR",
      "etaSeconds": 360,
      "earliestSeconds": 300,
      "latestSeconds": 420
    }
  ]
}

###
